{"type":"text","timestamp":1794565028588,"sessionID":"ses_e2b9b778effeSQq4IId0PmqU0C","part":{"id":"prt_1d4692d60001HHhELXF0EKzjWW","sessionID":"ses_e2b9b778effeSQq4IId0PmqU0C","messageID":"msg_1d46926ba001GDlLnZB0B4p679","type":"text","text":"T012 complete. Both named files are written and the verify command passed.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/metrics.ts`\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts`\n\n**Changes**\n- `AdvisorHookDiagnosticRecord` and the create input now carry `degraded?: boolean`, spread into the result only when true, and validated as undefined or boolean.\n- `persistAdvisorHookDiagnosticRecord` now writes with `{ requireDebug: false }` in both paths. With `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` set it serializes the record as-is; without it, it drops `skillLabel` and `errorDetails`. The durable-WHY comment is at the call site.\n- `AdvisorHookHealthSection` gains `rollingDegradedRate` and `lastRecordAt`; `buildAdvisorHookHealthSection` computes the degraded share over `lastInvocations` (0 when empty) and takes the newest record's timestamp (`null` when empty).\n- Added the two requested `STT` cases after `reports hook health from durable diagnostic records`, each deleting and restoring `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG`.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n$ env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts tests/legacy/advisor-observability.vitest.ts tests/legacy/advisor-privacy.vitest.ts tests/metrics-file-permissions.vitest.ts\n\n Test Files  4 passed (4)\n      Tests  47 passed (47)\n```\n\n```\n$ npm run typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\nEXIT:0\n```\n\n**Scope check**\n`git status --short` lists only the two named files. The comment-hygiene scan over their diff printed nothing (rg exit 1).\n\nNothing could not be done. The `tasks.md` checkbox was not ticked, and no build, daemon, hook, or git state was touched.","time":{"start":1794565025120,"end":1794565028588}}}
